From: B <Bhoneycutt153@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] OPENBOOK: route bridged Chromium services through managed aliases

Reject unsupported native-only service lookups before allocating service
records or blocking process starts. Chromium 158 itself only falls back
between native services, so map its two known renderer declarations to
the existing managed services when their access and sandbox contracts
match exactly. Use Android component alias semantics for callbacks.
Guard direct native-zygote calls too; keep the ARM64 application ABI.

